OL,4,BRussell fastest in Las Vegas practice  
OL,5,Bafter rain                             
OL,6,GMercedes driver George Russell topped  
OL,7,Ga second practice session at the Las   
OL,8,GVegas Grand Prix run on a wet but      
OL,9,Gslowly drying track.                   
OL,11,FRussell, competing with Red Bull's Max 
OL,12,FVerstappen for second in the           
OL,13,Fchampionship in the final three races  
OL,14,Fof the year, set his time right at the 
OL,15,Fend of the session.                    
OL,17,FThe same applied to Alpine's Pierre    
OL,18,FGasly, who went second, 0.071 seconds  
OL,19,Fbehind Russell, with a lap even later  
OL,20,Fthe Briton's.                          
